              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tokeikin akiroit ngina lorukitos a Yesu daang atamar nyetoani erukitos ngolo. Nakaneni pealimunit Yesu atamar nyetoani ngesi, arai abala, “Ani kasaki ayong ngesi toyar tanang na abunio ayong, nyo kon nguna?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.23"
            ]
